  "bio": "Alejandro Gomez is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Barcelona, Spain, specializing in illustrative, neotraditional, and anime designs. With a portfolio full of intricate and vivid creations, Alejandro's expertise brings each client's vision to life with stunning detail and artistry. Working out of the renowned Ensu Tinta Estudio in Sabadell, clients can expect a professional experience that is as memorable as the tattoos he expertly crafts.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain\n\n📍@moetattoostudio - STC \n📍@arrels_Tattoo- BCN\nConsultas o Citas al Dm 📥",
